sequenceDiagram

    Actor User as User
    participant UI as Client UI
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant TS as ThreadService
    participant DB as Database


    activate UI

    opt user first opens thread list in a session

    User->> UI: 1. requestThreadList()
    UI->>API: 2. GET /api/threads/get_all_threads
    activate API
    API->>TS: 3. getAllThreads()
    activate TS
    TS->>DB: 4. SELECT * FROM threads
    activate DB
    DB-->>TS: 5. {thread rows}
    deactivate DB
    TS-->>API: 6. Thread Array
    deactivate TS
    API-->>UI: 7. 200 OK (ThreadList)
    deactivate API
    UI-->>User: 8. sendThreadList(threads)

    end

    User->>UI: 9. requestThreadMessages(invalid_id)
    UI->>API: 10. GET /api/threads/{invalid_id}/messages
    activate API
    API->>TS: 11. getThreadMessages(invalid_id)
    activate TS
    TS->>DB: 12. SELECT * FROM messages WHERE thread_id = invalid_id
    activate DB
    DB-->>TS: 13. {empty response}
    deactivate DB
    alt thread found
        TS-->>API: 14. 200 OK (threadData)
        API-->>UI: 15. 200 OK (threadData)
        UI-->>User: 16. displayThread()
    else thread is null / deleted
        TS-->>API: 17.404 Thread Not Found
        API-->>UI: 18.404 Not Found (Error payload)
        UI-->>User: 19. showError("Thread not found") & redirectToList()
    end

    deactivate UI
